{"id": "27e06f4b-6796-4a33-b711-e9355157be9b", "slug": "portfolio-technical-system", "title": "Portfolio - Technical System", "description": "Portfolio Technical Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Portfolio - Technical System\"\ndescription: \"Portfolio Technical Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6D5DFB\"\n  secondary: \"#18181B\"\n  accent: \"#6D5DFB\"\n  background: \"#0F1115\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Portfolio - Technical System\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 313; favorites: 5; remixes: 7.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento, charts.\n## Overview\nPortfolio Technical Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAlex Smith Sys.Architect Index Archive Protocol Initiative.01 Architecting disciplined software systems and environments. Engineering robust applications and minimal interface architectures. Translating complex technica…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Architecting disciplined software systems and environments..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6D5DFB, secondary #18181B, accent #6D5DFB, background #0F1115, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Portfolio - Technical System</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        /* Hide scrollbar for technical aesthetic while keeping functionality */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 0px; background: transparent; }\n    </style>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-oswald\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-oswald\">.font-oswald { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-neutral-100 min-h-screen antialiased text-neutral-900 p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col font-sans\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Main Shell Container -->\n    <div class=\"flex-1 w-full bg-white border border-neutral-200 relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n\n        <!-- Structural Corner Markers (Outer Shell) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-r border-b border-neutral-300 pointer-events-none z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-l border-b border-neutral-300 pointer-events-none z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-r border-t border-neutral-300 pointer-events-none z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-l border-t border-neutral-300 pointer-events-none z-20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- LEFT PANEL: Informational & Structural -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 relative flex flex-col border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-neutral-200 p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-16 xl:p-20 z-10 bg-white\">\n\n            <!-- Technical Rail: Header -->\n            <header class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-24 lg:mb-auto\">\n                <!-- Identity -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-900 text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"font-medium text-base tracking-tight leading-none uppercase font-sans\">Alex Smith</div>\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-1.5 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Sys.Architect</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Mono Navigation -->\n                <nav class=\"hidden md:flex flex-col items-end gap-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 font-sans\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-300 rounded-full inline-block\"></span> Index\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 font-sans\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-transparent border border-neutral-300 rounded-full inline-block\"></span> Archive\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 font-sans\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-transparent border border-neutral-300 rounded-full inline-block\"></span> Protocol\n                    </a>\n                </nav>\n\n                <button class=\"md:hidden text-xl text-neutral-800\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Core Content Region -->\n            <main class=\"my-auto relative\">\n                <!-- Data Label -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-5-linear\"></iconify-icon> Initiative.01\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Structured Headline -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] text-neutral-900 gs-reveal-container\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-full font-oswald font-light tracking-tighter\">Architecting</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-full font-oswald font-light tracking-tighter\">disciplined</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-full text-neutral-400 font-oswald font-light tracking-tighter\">software systems</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-full font-oswald font-light tracking-tighter\">and environments.</div></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Body Text -->\n                <p class=\"mt-10 text-neutral-500 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-md leading-relaxed font-normal font-sans\">\n                    Engineering robust applications and minimal interface architectures. Translating complex technical requirements into scalable, precise digital structures.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Restrained Actions -->\n                <div class=\"mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n                    <button class=\"relative group overflow-hidden bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-transparent opacity-50 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-800 font-sans\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Execute Output\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <button class=\"bg-white border border-neutral-200 p-3 hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors text-neutral-600 flex items-center justify-center group\" aria-label=\"Repository\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <button class=\"bg-white border border-neutral-200 p-3 hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors text-neutral-600 flex items-center justify-center group\" aria-label=\"Documentation\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </main>\n\n            <!-- Technical Rail: Footer Meta -->\n            <footer class=\"mt-24 lg:mt-auto pt-8 border-t border-neutral-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-end gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 flex flex-col gap-1.5\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-sans\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-300\"></div> System Status: Active</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-sans\">Loc: 40.7128° N, 74.0060° W</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Partner / Network nodes in mono -->\n                <div class=\"flex gap-4 sm:gap-6 font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-300\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-neutral-500 transition-colors cursor-default font-sans\">D.Sync</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-neutral-500 transition-colors cursor-default font-sans\">C.Craft</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-neutral-500 transition-colors cursor-default font-sans\">V.Labs</span>\n                </div>\n            </footer>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- RIGHT PANEL: Visual & Spatial -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 relative bg-neutral-50 p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col z-0\">\n\n            <!-- Framed Media Surface -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 w-full relative border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-100 overflow-hidden group min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-0\">\n\n                <!-- Media Internal Framing & Labels -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border border-neutral-200 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 shadow-sm font-sans\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        Fig_01\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 z-10 flex gap-2\">\n                    <button class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border border-neutral-200 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors shadow-sm\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Central Alignment Crosshair -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 z-10 opacity-20 pointer-events-none mix-blend-difference\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-white -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 w-[1px] h-full bg-white -translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Architectural Background Object (Aura Asset) -->\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/93dbb379-52e9-4ded-bc8a-c0f05aef82c0_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Minimalist glass architecture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center grayscale-[15%] contrast-[1.05] js-image-settle transform scale-105\">\n\n                <!-- Subtle Gradient Overlay to flatten the image slightly for editorial feel -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-100/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Technical Rail: Visual Panel Bottom -->\n            <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-between items-center w-full font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-sans\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:scanner-linear\"></iconify-icon> Asset_Ref: 7F78131E\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"font-sans\">Scale: 1:100</div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Initialization Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Minimal, strict typography reveal\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".gs-reveal-container\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            tl.to(\".gs-reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                ease: \"expo.out\",\n                duration: 1.4,\n                stagger: 0.1\n            });\n\n            // Slow settle for the architectural image to give a sense of scale\n            gsap.to(\".js-image-settle\", {\n                scale: 1,\n                ease: \"power2.out\",\n                duration: 2.5,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "portfolio-technical-system.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/portfolio-technical-system.jpg", "source_name": "portfolio-technical-system-DESIGN.md", "views": 698, "forks": 13, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:03:09.5686+00:00"}